sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter Notebook)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Node<br/>10001/TCP mTLS
    participant Dashboard as Ray Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User, Dashboard: Flow 1: RayCluster Lifecycle (apply → ready → down)

    User->>SDK: Cluster(ClusterConfiguration(...)).apply()
    SDK->>K8s: Authenticate (kube-authkit)<br/>OIDC / OAuth / Token / kubeconfig
    K8s-->>SDK: Auth OK

    SDK->>K8s: List LocalQueues (kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1)
    K8s-->>SDK: Default LocalQueue name

    SDK->>K8s: Create RayCluster CR (ray.io/v1)<br/>with Kueue labels
    K8s-->>SDK: RayCluster created
    K8s->>KubeRay: Watch event: new RayCluster
    KubeRay->>K8s: Create head/worker Pods, Services

    loop Poll for CA Secret
        SDK->>K8s: Get Secret (ray.openshift.ai/cluster-name label)
        K8s-->>SDK: CA cert + key (when available)
    end

    SDK->>SDK: Generate RSA-3072 client cert<br/>signed by CA (SHA-256)<br/>Write to ~/.local/share/codeflare/tls/

    loop Wait for cluster ready
        SDK->>K8s: Get RayCluster status
        K8s-->>SDK: Status (pending/ready)
    end

    SDK->>Dashboard: GET readiness check<br/>Bearer Token auth
    Dashboard-->>SDK: 200 OK

    SDK->>RayHead: Connect (Ray Client Protocol)<br/>mTLS client certificate
    RayHead-->>SDK: Connection established

    SDK-->>User: Cluster ready ✓

    Note over User, Dashboard: Flow 2: RayJob Submission

    User->>SDK: RayJob(RayJobConfig(...)).submit()
    SDK->>K8s: Create Secret ({rayjob}-files)<br/>with local scripts + zipped working_dir<br/>ownerReference → RayJob
    K8s-->>SDK: Secret created

    SDK->>K8s: Create RayJob CR (ray.io/v1)<br/>with Kueue labels + file Secret mount
    K8s-->>SDK: RayJob created
    K8s->>KubeRay: Watch event: new RayJob

    opt Kueue Admission
        K8s->>Kueue: Workload created
        Kueue->>K8s: Admit workload (quota check)
    end

    loop Poll job status
        SDK->>K8s: Get RayJob status
        K8s-->>SDK: Status (pending/running/succeeded/failed)
    end

    SDK-->>User: Job result

    Note over User, Dashboard: Flow 3: Dashboard URL Discovery (RHOAI 3.x)

    User->>SDK: cluster.dashboard_uri()
    SDK->>K8s: List HTTPRoutes<br/>(label: ray.io/cluster-name)
    K8s-->>SDK: HTTPRoute with parentRef

    SDK->>K8s: Get Gateway CR<br/>(hostname from listeners)
    K8s-->>SDK: Gateway spec

    alt Hostname not in Gateway listeners
        SDK->>K8s: Get OpenShift Route<br/>(exposing Gateway)
        K8s-->>SDK: Route host
    end

    alt Hostname still unresolved
        SDK->>K8s: Get GatewayConfig CR<br/>(domain fallback)
        K8s-->>SDK: Domain value
    end

    SDK-->>User: Dashboard URL

    Note over User, Dashboard: Teardown

    User->>SDK: cluster.down()
    SDK->>K8s: Delete RayCluster CR
    K8s->>KubeRay: Watch event: RayCluster deleted
    KubeRay->>K8s: Cleanup Pods, Services
    SDK->>SDK: Delete local TLS certs
    SDK-->>User: Cluster removed ✓
